      "The deep nets come up heavy for the first time in eleven weeks. Taryn's vertical rigging worked: nets down forty metres on anchored cables, lifted by the crane they built out of trawler winches, and today they come up silver and thrashing, forty kilos, sixty, ninety — Nikos is shouting numbers from the deck of the *Ayia Marina* and Emiko Voss is laughing in a way that carries.",
      "One hundred and ten kilos. More than double the ration target. Enough to salt, enough to trade, enough to feed everyone for four days with leftovers.",
      "The whole eastern cluster comes out to watch the crane. Somebody bangs a wrench on a pot. Yuki Voss, fourteen, sits on a crate with her sketchbook and doesn't draw, just watches, which for Yuki is the highest compliment available.",
