      "Kael's crews have finished the first new structure off the salvaged eastern pontoons: a raised deck, six by four metres, on four lashed aluminium columns. Tomorrow they build the second. In six weeks they'll have a schoolhouse up there, off the damp, and the children will learn their letters eleven metres above the fish.",
